      "filename": "Doocot at Dolphingstone - geograph.org.uk - 155064.jpg",
      "title": "File:Doocot at Dolphingstone - geograph.org.uk - 155064.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/Doocot_at_Dolphingstone_-_geograph.org.uk_-_155064.jpg",
